 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tires",
   "text": "All remaining wheel rims appear to be in good condition, and all tires match the manufacturer's specifications and size. No tire or wheel issues were found at the time of inspection. All four tires on the vehicle are of the same brand and have sufficient remaining tire tread depth."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "There are minor misc scratches around the vehicle. Most too small to see in photos. The window trim and door seals were in good condition. The glass was free of visible damage, and the windshield wiper/washer functioned properly. Both the headlights and tail lights were clear and free of any visible cracks or other damage. Panel gaps and shut lines appeared to be normal."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. I noted a blemish on the driver side upholstery cushion. Refer to picture 43. The rear seat upholstery backrest has light discoloration. Refer to picture 52. I observed no smoke or unusual odors. The interior electronics and climate controls were operational. The windows, locks, and mirrors all functioned properly. Additionally, the gauges were operational."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "Surface rust can be found on some portions of the exhaust pipe, welds, and flanges which is a typical occurrence. There was no burning oil smell in the engine compartment after running the vehicle. Fasteners in the engine bay appeared generally intact and in place. Hoses, belts, axle boots, and visible bushings appeared sound."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "A scan of the ECU revealed no current, pending, or historic fault codes. The vehicle accelerated as expected, and it performed well in terms of ride quality, acceleration, and handling. The brakes were firm, with no detectable pulsation."
  }
 ],
